cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the associated article and this repository."
title: "RSPP: code and data for The Route Similarity Preservation Problem"
type: software
version: 1.1.0
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/matteogarbelli/rspp"
authors:
  - family-names: Garbelli
    given-names: Matteo
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1642-0846"
abstract: >-
  Standalone research implementation, seeded instance generator, 30 synthetic
  baseline-disruption instance pairs and a 12,735-record reported campaign for
  the article "The Route Similarity Preservation Problem: geometric deviation
  as an objective in evolutionary vehicle routing replanning". The code is
  MIT-licensed; other files use CC BY 4.0 (LICENSE-DATA).
keywords:
  - vehicle routing
  - dynamic replanning
  - route consistency
  - trajectory similarity
  - multi-objective evolutionary optimisation
  - constraint handling
